Independently implemented character-sticker production workflow and local frame-finishing helper.
The pixel-gif-sticker-pack concept was a functional reference. This package does not vendor
its source, prompts, character artwork or fonts, and claims no affiliation.

Code and documentation use the included MIT License. Pillow and fontTools are separately
licensed external dependencies. Input/output artwork and fonts have independent rights;
code licensing and a rights.json declaration do not grant character or font clearance.
No example character artwork, production output, third-party character or font is bundled.
Tests generate original geometric glyphs in a temporary directory only; those glyphs
are not readable Chinese and do not establish real-font rendering quality.
